{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1792477056316,"sessionID":"ses_ea80b5e43ffePj42WcJ1WmkCN5","part":{"partID":"prt_157f54cb2001EAwYL4FFx73b2j","sessionID":"ses_ea80b5e43ffePj42WcJ1WmkCN5","messageID":"msg_157f4fa28001aXBjXl10vThA6X","type":"tool","id":"call_00_ws680nxkjqvd1dbk729upzgd","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"limit":120,"path":"/Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_3a658ba085e8417ea6faad5cb0cdd493/attempt-1/blueprint-spec-review-0-ad1379367f3e742a-scenario_scope/source/SOURCE_MANIFEST.json"},"output":"Read file /Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_3a658ba085e8417ea6faad5cb0cdd493/attempt-1/blueprint-spec-review-0-ad1379367f3e742a-scenario_scope/source/SOURCE_MANIFEST.json, lines 1-120\n1: {\n2:  \"facts_view_digest\": \"241bf3d99ff497c30be8349cbc70529e08df6146736cb749b55268271889aa4b\",\n3:  \"scenario_id\": \"scn_7756e0007f6a463a97316f3f49c15248\",\n4:  \"scenario_revision\": 2,\n5:  \"schema\": \"atlas.source-manifest.v1\",\n6:  \"sources\": [\n7:   {\n8:    \"evidence_id\": null,\n9:    \"facts\": \"把偶然看到但当下不处理的外部网页链接留存，日后需要时能重新找到并回到原页面\",\n10:    \"facts_view_digest\": \"241bf3d99ff497c30be8349cbc70529e08df6146736cb749b55268271889aa4b\",\n11:    \"id\": \"S01\",\n12:    \"input_digest\": \"f57cbe177ca9c476d8dd783aa6ac0847d94e5397624923cec6c4c72bcc0c20a9\",\n13:    \"kind\": \"confirmed_input\",\n14:    \"source_path\": \"inputs/scenario.json\",\n15:    \"source_url\": null,\n16:    \"version\": \"scn_7756e0007f6a463a97316f3f49c15248@2\"\n17:   },\n18:   {\n19:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_05babdea64ba9858\",\n20:    \"facts\": \"New records are built with id `bm-${crypto.randomUUID()}`, hostname from getHostname(url), and defaults visitCount=0, visitedAt=null, isPinned=false, isArchived=false, createdAt=Date.now(); edits preserve the previous id, isPinned, isArchived, visitCount, createdAt, and visitedAt.\",\n21:    \"facts_view_digest\": \"241bf3d99ff497c30be8349cbc70529e08df6146736cb749b55268271889aa4b\",\n22:    \"id\": \"S02\",\n23:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n24:    \"source_path\": \"src/App.tsrx\",\n25:    \"source_url\": \"https://github.com/lakhindarpal/bookmark-manager/blob/539881bc67099d491e8ab6f85de0f443fa7de623/src/App.tsrx\",\n26:    \"version\": \"539881bc67099d491e8ab6f85de0f443fa7de623\"\n27:   },\n28:   {\n29:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_06c81a165e03c96a\",\n30:    \"facts\": \"Pin/Unpin and Edit actions are rendered only when the item is not archived, and Edit loads the item's url/title/description/tags/favicon into the dialog.\",\n31:    \"facts_view_digest\": \"241bf3d99ff497c30be8349cbc70529e08df6146736cb749b55268271889aa4b\",\n32:    \"id\": \"S03\",\n33:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n34:    \"source_path\": \"src/App.tsrx\",\n35:    \"source_url\": \"https://github.com/lakhindarpal/bookmark-manager/blob/539881bc67099d491e8ab6f85de0f443fa7de623/src/App.tsrx\",\n36:    \"version\": \"539881bc67099d491e8ab6f85de0f443fa7de623\"\n37:   },\n38:   {\n39:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_1596da4a90687ca5\",\n40:    \"facts\": \"The Valibot BookmarkFormSchema requires a non-empty URL matching /^https?:\\\\/\\\\/(?:[\\\\w-]+\\\\.)+[a-zA-Z]{2,}(?:\\\\/\\\\S*)?$/ and v.url, a non-empty title up to 100 chars, a non-empty description up to 280 chars, and 1-5 tags each up to 30 chars.\",\n41:    \"facts_view_digest\": \"241bf3d99ff497c30be8349cbc70529e08df6146736cb749b55268271889aa4b\",\n42:    \"id\": \"S04\",\n43:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n44:    \"source_path\": \"src/App.tsrx\",\n45:    \"source_url\": \"https://github.com/lakhindarpal/bookmark-manager/blob/539881bc67099d491e8ab6f85de0f443fa7de623/src/App.tsrx\",\n46:    \"version\": \"539881bc67099d491e8ab6f85de0f443fa7de623\"\n47:   },\n48:   {\n49:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_35e41aab676021eb\",\n50:    \"facts\": \"saveBookmark sets the record in the in-memory map then awaits db.bookmarks.put(bm); deleteBookmark removes from the map then awaits db.bookmarks.delete(id).\",\n51:    \"facts_view_digest\": \"241bf3d99ff497c30be8349cbc70529e08df6146736cb749b55268271889aa4b\",\n52:    \"id\": \"S06\",\n53:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n54:    \"source_path\": \"src/App.tsrx\",\n55:    \"source_url\": \"https://github.com/lakhindarpal/bookmark-manager/blob/539881bc67099d491e8ab6f85de0f443fa7de623/src/App.tsrx\",\n56:    \"version\": \"539881bc67099d491e8ab6f85de0f443fa7de623\"\n57:   },\n58:   {\n59:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_4c56ef30a1785be1\",\n60:    \"facts\": \"A Delete action is rendered only for archived items; it calls deleteBookmark and shows an error-type toast with an Undo action that calls saveBookmark(item) to restore the record.\",\n61:    \"facts_view_digest\": \"241bf3d99ff497c30be8349cbc70529e08df6146736cb749b55268271889aa4b\",\n62:    \"id\": \"S07\",\n63:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n64:    \"source_path\": \"src/App.tsrx\",\n65:    \"source_url\": \"https://github.com/lakhindarpal/bookmark-manager/blob/539881bc67099d491e8ab6f85de0f443fa7de623/src/App.tsrx\",\n66:    \"version\": \"539881bc67099d491e8ab6f85de0f443fa7de623\"\n67:   },\n68:   {\n69:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_7150b0ac7a5678db\",\n70:    \"facts\": \"A Copy URL action writes item.url to the clipboard and shows a success toast.\",\n71:    \"facts_view_digest\": \"241bf3d99ff497c30be8349cbc70529e08df6146736cb749b55268271889aa4b\",\n72:    \"id\": \"S12\",\n73:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n74:    \"source_path\": \"src/App.tsrx\",\n75:    \"source_url\": \"https://github.com/lakhindarpal/bookmark-manager/blob/539881bc67099d491e8ab6f85de0f443fa7de623/src/App.tsrx\",\n76:    \"version\": \"539881bc67099d491e8ab6f85de0f443fa7de623\"\n77:   },\n78:   {\n79:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_86ed2327f33a3ca8\",\n80:    \"facts\": \"An effect on component creation calls db.bookmarks.toArray() and inserts each returned bookmark into an in-memory RippleMap keyed by bookmark id.\",\n81:    \"facts_view_digest\": \"241bf3d99ff497c30be8349cbc70529e08df6146736cb749b55268271889aa4b\",\n82:    \"id\": \"S13\",\n83:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n84:    \"source_path\": \"src/App.tsrx\",\n85:    \"source_url\": \"https://github.com/lakhindarpal/bookmark-manager/blob/539881bc67099d491e8ab6f85de0f443fa7de623/src/App.tsrx\",\n86:    \"version\": \"539881bc67099d491e8ab6f85de0f443fa7de623\"\n87:   },\n88:   {\n89:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_8e11efc61a4650ba\",\n90:    \"facts\": \"On submit, if no favicon exists and a hostname is derivable, the code fetches a Google s2 favicon proxied through images.weserv.nl inside a try/catch that only logs failure.\",\n91:    \"facts_view_digest\": \"241bf3d99ff497c30be8349cbc70529e08df6146736cb749b55268271889aa4b\",\n92:    \"id\": \"S14\",\n93:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n94:    \"source_path\": \"src/App.tsrx\",\n95:    \"source_url\": \"https://github.com/lakhindarpal/bookmark-manager/blob/539881bc67099d491e8ab6f85de0f443fa7de623/src/App.tsrx\",\n96:    \"version\": \"539881bc67099d491e8ab6f85de0f443fa7de623\"\n97:   },\n98:   {\n99:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_93ff254508846f11\",\n100:    \"facts\": \"The Visit action builds an updated bookmark with visitedAt=Date.now() and visitCount+1, calls saveBookmark(updated), then opens the URL with window.open(item.url, '_blank', 'noopener,noreferrer').\",\n101:    \"facts_view_digest\": \"241bf3d99ff497c30be8349cbc70529e08df6146736cb749b55268271889aa4b\",\n102:    \"id\": \"S15\",\n103:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n104:    \"source_path\": \"src/App.tsrx\",\n105:    \"source_url\": \"https://github.com/lakhindarpal/bookmark-manager/blob/539881bc67099d491e8ab6f85de0f443fa7de623/src/App.tsrx\",\n106:    \"version\": \"539881bc67099d491e8ab6f85de0f443fa7de623\"\n107:   },\n108:   {\n109:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_9ab6b0e51811a16d\",\n110:    \"facts\": \"The displayed list filters by isArchived matching the active tab, requires every selected tag to be present in bookmark.tags, matches search only against bookmark.title.toLowerCase(), and sorts pinned-first then by the chosen sort mode with createdAt descending as fallback.\",\n111:    \"facts_view_digest\": \"241bf3d99ff497c30be8349cbc70529e08df6146736cb749b55268271889aa4b\",\n112:    \"id\": \"S16\",\n113:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n114:    \"source_path\": \"src/App.tsrx\",\n115:    \"source_url\": \"https://github.com/lakhindarpal/bookmark-manager/blob/539881bc67099d491e8ab6f85de0f443fa7de623/src/App.tsrx\",\n116:    \"version\": \"539881bc67099d491e8ab6f85de0f443fa7de623\"\n117:   },\n118:   {\n119:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_b1ca64cf2ad02998\",\n120:    \"facts\": \"The Archive/Unarchive action toggles isArchived and, when archiving, forces isPinned=false before saving.\",\n[Output truncated. Continue reading with offset: 121]","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":true},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file /Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_3a658ba085e8417ea6faad5cb0cdd493/attempt-1/blueprint-spec-review-0-ad1379367f3e742a-scenario_scope/source/SOURCE_MANIFEST.json, lines 1-120\n1: {\n2:  \"facts_view_digest\": \"241bf3d99ff497c30be8349cbc70529e08df6146736cb749b55268271889aa4b\",\n3:  \"scenario_id\": \"scn_7756e0007f6a463a97316f3f49c15248\",\n4:  \"scenario_revision\": 2,\n5:  \"schema\": \"atlas.source-manifest.v1\",\n6:  \"sources\": [\n7:   {\n8:    \"evidence_id\": null,\n9:    \"facts\": \"把偶然看到但当下不处理的外部网页链接留存，日后需要时能重新找到并回到原页面\",\n10:    \"facts_view_digest\": \"241bf3d99ff497c30be8349cbc70529e08df6146736cb749b55268271889aa4b\",\n11:    \"id\": \"S01\",\n12:    \"input_digest\": \"f57cbe177ca9c476d8dd783aa6ac0847d94e5397624923cec6c4c72bcc0c20a9\",\n13:    \"kind\": \"confirmed_input\",\n14:    \"source_path\": \"i