ically for the sidebar.\",\n131:    \"facts_view_digest\": \"241bf3d99ff497c30be8349cbc70529e08df6146736cb749b55268271889aa4b\",\n132:    \"id\": \"S20\",\n133:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n134:    \"source_path\": \"src/App.tsrx\",\n135:    \"source_url\": \"https://github.com/lakhindarpal/bookmark-manager/blob/539881bc67099d491e8ab6f85de0f443fa7de623/src/App.tsrx\",\n136:    \"version\": \"539881bc67099d491e8ab6f85de0f443fa7de623\"\n137:   },\n138:   {\n139:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_ec303a2fd1afa287\",\n140:    \"facts\": \"fetchMeta calls https://api.microlink.io/?url=... and, on success with result.data, sets title/description and fetches the logo through https://images.weserv.nl/; errors are only console.error'd and the finally block resets loading.\",\n141:    \"facts_view_digest\": \"241bf3d99ff497c30be8349cbc70529e08df6146736cb749b55268271889aa4b\",\n142:    \"id\": \"S21\",\n143:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n144:    \"source_path\": \"src/App.tsrx\",\n145:    \"source_url\": \"https://github.com/lakhindarpal/bookmark-manager/blob/539881bc67099d491e8ab6f85de0f443fa7de623/src/App.tsrx\",\n146:    \"version\": \"539881bc67099d491e8ab6f85de0f443fa7de623\"\n147:   }\n148:  ]\n149: }"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"limit\": 220, \"offset\": 120, \"path\": \"/Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_3a658ba085e8417ea6faad5cb0cdd493/attempt-1/blueprint-spec-review-0-ad1379367f3e742a-scenario_scope/source/SOURCE_MANIFEST.json\"}"},"time":{"start":1792477128285,"end":1792477128374}}}}
